%% Download Map Sequence
sequenceDiagram
    title Download Map - CharAI Backend

    actor Farmer
    participant Frontend
    participant "Backend API" as API
    storage "File Storage" as Storage

    note over Farmer,Storage: User downloads generated map
    Farmer->>Frontend: Click "Download Map"
    Frontend->>API: GET /download-map/{id}
    API->>Storage: Retrieve map file
    Storage-->>API: Return file stream
    API-->>Frontend: Send file
    Frontend-->>Farmer: Map downloaded